/* 购物车（v5「字重」稿 A4）：头（标题+小货车）固定、列表滚、底（小计+结算）固定在 TabBar 上方 */
page {
  background: var(--v5-canvas);
  color: var(--v5-ink);
}
.ca {
  box-sizing: border-box;
  height: 100vh;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}
.ca-head {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  height: 44px;
  padding: 0 104px 0 16px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
}
.ca-title {
  font-size: 20px;
  font-weight: 700;
}
/* 小货车：顶栏下 groundGap 处落地（屏高<700 为 56、其余 120·lib/ground·全站同一条地面线） */
.ca-truck {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  padding: 0 16px 12px;
}

.ca-list {
  flex: 1;
  height: 0;
}
.ca-rows {
  padding: 0 16px;
}
.ca-row:last-child {
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--v5-hair);
}
.ca-row {
  padding: 12px 0;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--v5-hair);
}
.ca-check-hit {
  width: 44px;
  height: 44px;
  margin: 0 -11px;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}
.ca-check {
  width: 22px;
  height: 22px;
  padding: 0;
  border-radius: 4px;
}
.ca-thumb {
  width: 52px;
  height: 52px;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  border-radius: 4px;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, var(--v5-sunk) 0 5px, var(--v5-sunk-2) 5px 10px);
}
.ca-thumb-img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  background-size: cover;
  background-position: 50% 40%;
}
.ca-mid {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 4px;
}
.ca-name {
  font-size: 17px;
  font-weight: 500;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.ca-sku {
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 300;
  color: var(--v5-ink-2);
}
.ca-right {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: flex-end;
  gap: 8px;
}
.ca-price {
  font-size: 15px;
  font-weight: 600;
}
.ca-price-off {
  color: var(--v5-ink-2);
}
.ca-step {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
}
.ca-step-hit {
  width: 34px;
  height: 44px; /* 热区 ≥44px（键帽本身 28px 不变） */
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}
/* 热区往外让 3px（设计稿）：减/删键左让、加键右让——加键右边与上面价格右边对齐 */
.ca-step-l {
  margin: -8px 0 -8px -3px;
}
.ca-step-r {
  margin: -8px -3px -8px 0;
}
/* 宽度往外再让 10px（伪元素扩热区·视觉不动）：减/删向左让进行间空隙，加向右让进页边距——合计 44×44 */
.ca-step-hit {
  position: relative;
}
.ca-step-hit::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  width: 10px;
}
.ca-step-l::after {
  left: -10px;
}
.ca-step-r::after {
  right: -10px;
}
.ca-step-key {
  position: relative;
  width: 28px;
  height: 28px;
  padding: 0;
  border-radius: 4px;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.ca-qty {
  width: 24px;
  text-align: center;
  font-size: 15px;
  font-weight: 600;
}
/* 按住删除：红字 ×，按住时浅红从左往右填满（HOLD_MS 0.6s） */
.ca-del {
  color: var(--v5-err-text);
}
.ca-del-fill {
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  top: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  width: 100%;
  transform: scaleX(0);
  transform-origin: left;
  background: var(--v5-err-soft);
}
.ca-del-on .ca-del-fill {
  transform: scaleX(1);
  transition: transform 600ms linear;
}

/* 底部：小计（点线引导）+ 结算 */
.ca-foot {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  padding: 12px 16px 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 12px;
}
.ca-sum {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
}
.ca-sum-k {
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 300;
  color: var(--v5-ink-2);
}
.ca-leader {
  flex: 1;
  height: 2px;
  background: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, var(--v5-rule) 0 2px, transparent 2px 4px);
}
.ca-sum-v {
  font-size: 15px;
}
.ca-policy {
  margin-top: -8px;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 300;
  color: var(--v5-ink-2);
}

.ca-empty {
  padding: 24px 16px 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 20px;
}
.ca-empty-t {
  font-size: 17px;
  font-weight: 500;
}
/* TabBar 占高：上 8 + 键 44 + 下 max(24, 安全区)，再留 12 呼吸 */
.ca-tab-space {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  height: calc(64px + max(24px, env(safe-area-inset-bottom)));
}
